{"id":"ebabc4cd0b0d94d0","group":"93","path":"93/93-prop-isomorphism-theorem.md","title":"General Isomorphism","display":"General Isomorphism","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-prop-isomorphism-theorem","aliases":["93-prop-isomorphism-theorem"],"display":"General Isomorphism","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]","[[93-df-quotient-algebra]]","[[93-df-isomorphism]]","[[93-lem-congruence-kernel]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-prop-isomorphism-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-prop-isomorphism-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"General Isomorphism"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f176786881b1435\" href=\"?note=4f176786881b1435\" title=\"93-lem-congruence-kernel\">93-lem-congruence-kernel</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"prop-isomorphism-theorem-—-General-Isomorphism\">prop-isomorphism-theorem — General Isomorphism</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|\">\\(h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A)\\)</span> is the kernel congruence of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f176786881b1435\" href=\"?note=4f176786881b1435\" title=\"93-lem-congruence-kernel\">93-lem-congruence-kernel</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}\\)</span> is the isomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fe06c83d404633c2\" href=\"?note=fe06c83d404633c2\" title=\"93-df-isomorphism\">93-df-isomorphism</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}\\)</span> are the type-indexed quotient and projection constructors of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"510bd94349c4c6d9\" href=\"?note=510bd94349c4c6d9\" title=\"93-df-quotient-algebra\">93-df-quotient-algebra</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|\n\\to\\exists!\\widetilde h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(\\widetilde h,\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A);\\tau),\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\widetilde h\\circ\n\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A);\\tau)=h\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}isomorphism\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(h,\\mathbf A,\\mathbf B)\\land h[|\\mathbf A|]=|\\mathbf B|\n\\to\\exists!\\widetilde h\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Iso}_{93}(\\widetilde h,\n\\mathrm{Quot}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A);\\tau),\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\widetilde h\\circ\n\\mathrm{QuotProj}_{93}(\\mathbf A,\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(h;\\mathbf A);\\tau)=h\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The First Isomorphism Theorem shows that the image of a homomorphism is always isomorphic to a quotient of the domain by the kernel.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"prop-isomorphism-theorem-—-General-Isomorphism","text":"prop-isomorphism-theorem — General Isomorphism","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f10e7e3251fa7f7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quotient-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"510bd94349c4c6d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","head